Package: cotanisoform
Type: Package
Title: Isoform-Aware COTAN for Differential Transcript Usage
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Lorenzo", "Delitala", email = "ldelitala@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Adapts COTAN co-expression and zero-count statistics from gene level to
    transcript (isoform) level to detect differential transcript usage in single-cell
    RNA-seq data. Provides COTAN object construction from Seurat objects, cell, gene and
    cluster metadata handling, co-expression, p-value and GDI computation, guided
    clustering, cluster-level differential expression analysis and differential
    transcript usage candidate extraction, together with structured workflow logging and
    Seurat clean-up helpers.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/ldelitala/sc-isoform-cotan
